INSAPOS v2.2f: Fix scan lag, broken icons, and comprehensive bug audit

Scan fixes (root cause: blocking @JavascriptInterface calls):
- Replaced synchronous window.INSAPOS.scanBarcode() with async fetch()
  to the local HTTP server — eliminates UI freeze during scan
- Added _scanning lock to prevent duplicate scan triggers
- Product scan and rewards scan now show immediate "Scanning..." feedback
- Scan results are properly parsed and handled for both product and customer

Icon/button fixes:
- Product scan button now always visible (blue when scanner available)
- Cash drawer button now works with both INSABuddy AND native bridge
- Removed broken buddyScanBarcode() — unified into scanProduct()

Data integrity fixes:
- Customer lookup now returns numeric `id` for member_id FK
- JS customer mappers use numeric id (not uuid) for sale tagging
- Fixed potential null concatenation in customer name formatting

API fix:
- CustomerLookupController::formatCustomer() now includes `id` (getKey())

Version: v2.2f (versionCode 6)
